### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/api/health

### Caregiver Identity & Assigned Elders (Replace with your Cognito ID Token)
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/api/me
Authorization: Bearer <COGNITO_ID_TOKEN>

### Get elderly user profile (Shanti Devi - ID: 1)
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer <COGNITO_ID_TOKEN>

### Get elderly user dashboard status (Shanti Devi - ID: 1)
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/api/users/1/status
Authorization: Bearer <COGNITO_ID_TOKEN>

### Get elderly user interactions history (Shanti Devi - ID: 1)
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/api/users/1/interactions?limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer <COGNITO_ID_TOKEN>

### Voice intent ingestion / dev simulator (Protected with x-voice-api-key)
POST http://127.0.0.1:4000/api/voice/intent
Content-Type: application/json
x-voice-api-key: voice-secret-key-presence-demo

{
  "userId": 1,
  "sessionId": "session-dev-simulator-1",
  "interactionIntent": "daily_check_in",
  "transcript": "Namaste, I took my morning medicine and had breakfast.",
  "response": "Namaste Shanti ji! Great to hear.",
  "summary": "Morning check-in confirmed medicine and breakfast.",
  "moodScore": 0.800,
  "confidenceScore": 0.900,
  "sentimentLabel": "positive"
}
